//RS /// Build the lowering context of one loaded source module for a comptime
//RS /// fragment, the way runtime lowering builds it for an imported module: the
//RS /// module's own functions and imports, its loader alias as the local call
//RS /// prefix and its checked identity as the owner of every lowered body. A user
//RS /// file module also sees every checked nominal row by its canonical identity
//RS /// and spells its own and imported types through its identity table.
//RS fn fragment_core_source_cx(
//RS     facts: &crate::Comptime::MirBridge::MirFragmentNominalFacts,
//RS     source: &crate::Comptime::MirBridge::MirFragmentCoreSourceModule,
